      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(proxy-capture): wrap deletePathBasedSessions in transaction",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\nTwo DELETE statements in `deletePathBasedSessions` ran as separate auto-commit operations. A mid-operation crash could leave `capture_events` and `capture_sessions` inconsistent.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nWrap in `runSqliteImmediateTransactionSync`, matching the sibling `deleteSessions()` method.\n\n## User Impact\nNo user-visible change. Prevents data inconsistency on crash during proxy capture cleanup.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98852-proof.png)\n- Source verified: both DELETEs in single transaction, same helper at lines 336/608",
